<p>Improves your damage with shield-based skills, and increases your Spell (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+3, +5, +6, +8, +10</acronym>) and Physical (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+5, +9, +13, +16, +20</acronym>) Saves.</p>